  "title": "Formalities of conclusion, without a rule — formality provided and formality pending, side by side",
  "titleEs": "Formalidades de celebración — Comparación de dos supuestos",
  "category": "contract-formation",
  "categoryName": "Formación del contrato",
  "motif": "Formalidades de celebración",
  "treatment": "contrast",
  "family": "paired-comparison",
  "description": "Two identical stages (two parties and their pigeonhole racks): in both, each party hands its document to the other (● Party A's, ◆ Party B's, at equal weight) at the same moments and each document is connected with its steps as supplied in the scenario (flap open, a connector drawn to a node at each step row). The one changed fact is the supplied status of the formality: provided in A, pending in B — in B a dashed pending ring round Party B's document, a neutral pending state only. A guide outlines the differing row of the comparison table; the key reads \"As supplied · no conclusion drawn\". No winner, no formality rule and no legal effect is stated.",
